<title>UK: Select Appointments leaps after acquisition.</title>
<headline>Select Appointments leaps after acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Select Appointments (Holdings) Plc were among the day's best performing stocks on the London stock market on Thursday after the company said it had acquired a Dutch human resources group.</p>
<p>By 1504 GMT the shares had gained nearly nine percent or 26-1/2p at 323p.</p>
<p>Earlier the company said it had acquired Skillco Human Resources Management and four of its subsidiaries for a maximum consideration of 2.4 million stg to be paid from existing cash resources.</p>
